---
layout: base.njk
title: Subscribe
dek: The free daily brief, and paid plans that fund the reporting.
permalink: /subscribe/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="shell page">

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="chip">Support</div>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Reporting costs money. Ads alone won't cover the Pacific</h1>
      <p class="hero__dek">Free to read, funded by readers. Every subscription pays for travel, translation, and records requests.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rail__stack">
        <div class="rail__label">{{ site.founded }}</div>
        <div class="rail__line"></div>
        <div class="rail__sub">Why it matters</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rail__word">why</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cols">
    <div class="cols__main">

      <p class="prose" style="font-size:20px;line-height:1.72;font-weight:400;color:var(--body);margin-bottom:30px">Vox Meridian is free to read. Subscriptions pay for reporting trips, translators, and public-records requests across the Pacific — nothing else.</p>

      <div class="plans">
        {% for p in plans %}
        <div class="plan plan--{{ p.tone }}">
          <div class="kicker">{{ p.name }}</div>
          <div class="plan__price">{{ p.price }}</div>
          <div class="plan__cadence">{{ p.cadence }}</div>
          <div class="plan__what">{{ p.what }}</div>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn {% if p.tone == 'dark' %}btn--light{% endif %}">{{ p.cta }}</a>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <section class="panel panel--light" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px)">
        <h2 class="panel__title">The daily brief</h2>
        <p class="panel__text">One email each weekday morning — the three stories that matter across the Pacific and Washington. Free, no paywall.</p>
        <form name="newsletter" method="POST" action="/thanks/?form=newsletter" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:flex-end">
          <p class="vh"><label>Do not fill this in <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
          <label class="field" style="flex:1 1 240px;min-width:0"><span class="field__label">Email address</span><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Sign up free</button>
        </form>
      </section>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px)">
        <h2>What your money does not buy</h2>
        <p>Influence over coverage. Subscribers do not see stories early, do not get to kill one, and are not told who we are talking to. If that is what you are paying for, we are the wrong outlet.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="cols__aside">
      <div>
        <h2 class="rule-head">Elsewhere on Vox</h2>
        <div class="sidelist">
          {% for post in collections.articles | limit(4) %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">
            <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:6px">{{ post.data.section }}</div>
            <div class="sidelist__title">{{ post.data.title }}</div>
            <div class="sidelist__meta">{{ post.date | timeAgo }}</div>
          </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kicker kicker--light" style="margin-bottom:12px">Where we report from</div>
        <div class="bureaus">
          {% for b in bureaus %}
          <div class="bureaus__row">
            <span class="bureaus__city">{{ b.city }}</span>
            <span class="bureaus__beat">{{ b.beat }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

</div>
